{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28324","headline":"自遣 · 杜牧","name":"自遣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四十已云老，况逢忧窘余。\n且抽持板手，却展小年书。\n嗜酒狂嫌阮，知非晚笑蘧。\n闻流宁叹吒，待俗不亲疎。\n遇事知裁剪，操心识卷舒。\n还称二千石，於我意何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}